# The render mode's dependencies besides the stdlib: this and tokenizers.  tokenizers is pinned
# inside transformers 5.9.0's own range (Requires-Dist: tokenizers<=0.23.0,>=0.22.0): with the name
# left unpinned, `uv pip compile --no-deps` resolves the newest release, which the family's own pin
# forbids -- the bootstrap's completion step then fails the import check (the r4 wave's
# huggingface-hub incident: `huggingface-hub is installed at 1.33.0, the lock pins 2.2.0`).  The
# pinned range resolves to 0.22.2, the newest release the range allows (0.23.0 was never published);
# huggingface-hub 1.33.0 (inside 5.9.0's own >=1.5.0,<2.0 range) is what the staged wheelhouse
# carries.
huggingface-hub>=1.5,<2.0
tokenizers>=0.22.0,<=0.23.0
